{"id":"bf103f8baf1db1b8","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-inductive-definition.md","title":"Inductive Definition","display":"df-inductive-definition — Inductive Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-inductive-definition","aliases":["72-df-inductive-definition"],"display":"df-inductive-definition — Inductive Definition","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §3.2.1; print269; PDF281","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-inductive-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-inductive-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inductive-definition — Inductive Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §3.2.1; print269; PDF281"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\Phi:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall X,Y\\subseteq A\\ (X\\subseteq Y\\to\\Phi(X)\\subseteq\\Phi(Y))\">\\(\\forall X,Y\\subseteq A\\ (X\\subseteq Y\\to\\Phi(X)\\subseteq\\Phi(Y))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\)</span> 由下式引入；不预先假设任何不动点存在。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi):=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq A:\\Phi(X)\\subseteq X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi):=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq A:\\Phi(X)\\subseteq X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi))=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq A\\ (\\Phi(X)\\subseteq X\\to\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\subseteq X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi(\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi))=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq A\\ (\\Phi(X)\\subseteq X\\to\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\subseteq X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 IV 章 §3.2.1，印刷 p.269 / PDF p.281。令 I 为所示交集。I⊆X 对所有前不动点 X 成立，单调性给 Φ(I)⊆Φ(X)⊆X，所以 Φ(I)⊆I；再由单调性得 Φ(Φ(I))⊆Φ(I)，故 Φ(I) 也在交集族内，推出 I⊆Φ(I)。最小性由交集直接成立。这证明的是唯一最小不动点，不是算子只有一个不动点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall X,Y\\subseteq A\\ (X\\subseteq Y\\to\\Phi(X)\\subseteq\\Phi(Y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi):=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq A:\\Phi(X)\\subseteq X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi(\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi))=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\land\\forall X\\subseteq A\\ (\\Phi(X)\\subseteq X\\to\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)\\subseteq X).","display":true}],"bytes":1384,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-inductive-definition|df-inductive-definition — Inductive Definition]]"},{"id":"3d1347d7f1a6c20f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9bdf03cc14658aa0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Phi_a:\\mathcal P(U)^{A_{<a}}\\times\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)$ 是给定的集合函数；对每个历史 H，它在第二参数单调。$\\operatorname{Ind}$ 见 [[72-df-inductive-definition]]。"},{"id":"c924a0bbc6eed2cd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-inductive-definition|df-inductive-definition — Inductive Definition]]"},{"id":"cee8253e7f3f324a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\Phi:\\mathcal P(A)\\to\\mathcal P(A)$ 为单调函数；$I=\\operatorname{Ind}(\\Phi)$ 见 [[72-df-inductive-definition]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}